      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "Of these, 30 articles were included in the final review, with 16 being quantitative and 14 either qualitative or mixed methods studies.",
      "reason": "The review specifies groups used in synthesis (quantitative versus qualitative/mixed methods) and links included studies to these categories for analysis."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
